  "about": "AC-LNT-03 (PRD §3.9.4, ARCHITECTURE §4.13): the slur filter's parity fixture. Its list is a stand-in of harmless and made-up words, so the fixture holds no real term. Every case runs through the engine's isBlocked (src/engine/text/moderation.test.ts) and, through supabase/tests/generated/moderation.test.sql, which npm run codegen:moderation writes from this file, through private.text_blocked_by: the same verdicts on both sides. Both sides also compile the list to exactly the sources in patterns. innocent holds more than 100 innocent words that contain a short listed string, which must all pass.",
